{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             こんばんは　"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒くなってきましたが、\nみなさんいかがお過ごしですか？　今年はどんなマフラーにしようかしら🤔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"　友達とピクニックに行ったら\n風が強くないのでそれほど寒くなくて、\n陽の光が暖かくてとてもとても気持ちよくて✨\nハマりそうです〜！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーも終わり、久しぶりに友達と会って、\nたくさんリフレッシュしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0TDFNH7C3PANTKM6NNRG5B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0TDGNF1JEJ0A8ADAR9ZZB1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0TDHM502AYFK4BGVVXGHPG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0TDJP87VBK4CKBVYP8BJG1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなブログやメッセージ用にと、\nたくさん写真撮ってくれる。優しい🥲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あおたんとデートなうにでも使ってください。(もう古そう)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あおい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"}],"source":"archive"}